desc North Ayrshire Council (NAC) is seeking to procure a cloud-hosted Integrated Workplace Management System (IWMS) to replace its existing Computer Aided Facilities Management (CAFM) solution. The new solution will provide a single, integrated platform to support the management of the Council's operational property portfolio, encompassing asset management, maintenance management, statutory compliance, financial monitoring, reporting and governance.
